WEBVTT

00:08:28.657 --> 00:08:30.013
Right?

00:08:30.037 --> 00:08:32.728
So I bought into this a little bit too,

00:08:32.752 --> 00:08:36.649
which is why the next time
I taught the course

00:08:36.673 --> 00:08:40.055
I proposed a freedom of speech debate.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:46.108
The N-word in academic spaces,
for or against?

00:08:47.473 --> 00:08:49.657
I was certain students would be eager

00:08:49.681 --> 00:08:52.569
to debate who gets to say it
and who doesn't.

00:08:53.744 --> 00:08:54.894
But they weren't.

00:08:56.871 --> 00:08:58.021
Instead ...